Hi all,

The manual lists this ML as the place to go for information related to the =
intel_gpu_top application. I'm currently running application version 1.26 w=
ith an Arc A770 with host platform of an AlderLake 12700k, with upstream me=
sa (.23) and kernel 6.2.

I'd like to request the ability/ behaviour of listing all available cards i=
n the application.

As of now I can target individual devices via the CLI switches, but no "com=
bined" view.

If this feature can be added to the roadmap, that'd be swell.

Felix LeClair

